{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Hecke.ProductionOcneanuBondProduct","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Hecke.ProductionOcneanuBondProduct","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.HeckeColimitMarkovTrace","lean:module:QOU.Hecke.PureBondChainProduct","lean:module:QOU.Mass.ProductionChainBondProduct"],"declarations":6,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.ProductionOcneanuBondProduct.interiorMarkov_ocneanu","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.ProductionOcneanuBondProduct.interiorMarkov_ocneanu","kind":"theorem","line":122,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/ProductionOcneanuBondProduct.lean#L122-L126","doc":"`InteriorMarkov` holds at the production trace — the hypothesis the three\nresults above are built on, discharged rather than assumed. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.ProductionOcneanuBondProduct.tr_productionChain_ocneanu","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.ProductionOcneanuBondProduct.tr_productionChain_ocneanu","kind":"theorem","line":104,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/ProductionOcneanuBondProduct.lean#L104-L120","doc":"**The production strand layout at the production trace.**  The inter-nucleon\nbridges sit at `σ_{3k+2}` (`StrandLayoutForcesChain` upstream), and `#7281`'s\n`tr_productionChain_braided` factorises over them; here with `z` substituted.\n\nThe `d k` are arbitrary: the letter identification is not claimed. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.ProductionOcneanuBondProduct.tr_pureBondChain_ocneanu","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.ProductionOcneanuBondProduct.tr_pureBondChain_ocneanu","kind":"theorem","line":91,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/ProductionOcneanuBondProduct.lean#L91-L102","doc":"**The pure bond chain at the production trace**, in closed form in `q`:\n\n`tr((σ_{g₀} + d₀)(σ_{g₁} + d₁)⋯) = ∏ₖ (q³/(q²+1) + d k)`\n\nfor strictly increasing bonds.  `#7337`'s `tr_pureBondChain_of_braided`,\ninstantiated.  This is the statement that was previously about a class. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.ProductionOcneanuBondProduct.tr_bondWord_ocneanu","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.ProductionOcneanuBondProduct.tr_bondWord_ocneanu","kind":"theorem","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/ProductionOcneanuBondProduct.lean#L78-L89","doc":"**General bond word at the production trace.**  `#7265`'s\n`tr_bondWord_of_braided`, instantiated, with `z` substituted. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.ProductionOcneanuBondProduct.prodZ_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.ProductionOcneanuBondProduct.prodZ_eq","kind":"theorem","line":72,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/ProductionOcneanuBondProduct.lean#L72-L76","doc":"**The substitution.**  The Markov parameter of the production trace is\n`q³/(q²+1)` — convention D.  Every product below is a product in `q` because of\nthis one `rfl`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Hecke.ProductionOcneanuBondProduct.prodTrace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Hecke.ProductionOcneanuBondProduct.prodTrace","kind":"def","line":68,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Hecke/ProductionOcneanuBondProduct.lean#L68-L70","doc":"The production Ocneanu trace on the Iwahori–Hecke colimit. ","signatureChunk":0}]}